PREPARE no_rules(text) AS SELECT id FROM products
WHERE description ||| (SELECT pdb.expand($1, rule) FROM shop_synonyms WHERE shop = 'none')
ORDER BY id;
SET plan_cache_mode = force_generic_plan;
EXECUTE no_rules('sofa');
WARNING:  a `pdb.expand` subquery reads its rules from the table on every query, because "shop_synonyms" has no synonym index for these rules with the tokenizer of field `description`. To disable this warning: SET paradedb.planner_warnings = 'off'
